        <p class="lede">
          Boba Tea Protein Classic Milk Tea is the best boba protein powder for most people: 25 g of grass-fed whey isolate, under 1 g of sugar, real black tea and about $2.40 per 25 g of protein at the Amazon price we saw. If you need it vegan, Lunar Lifts Brown Sugar is the pick. Below are five picks, the brands people confuse, and what the "controversy" searches turn up.
        </p>

        <QuickPicks products={PRODUCTS} />

