              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm m-0">
                Boba Tea Protein Classic Milk Tea has about 100 mg of caffeine per scoop from real black tea, roughly a cup of coffee. Taro has none. If you drink a shake in the evening, or two a day alongside coffee, check which flavor you bought before you blame the protein for a bad night's sleep.
