              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm m-0">
                They are separate companies with similar names and similar products. Boba Tea Protein sells on Amazon; Boba Nutrition, as far as we found, sells only on its own site. Reviews, complaints and discount codes for one do not apply to the other, so check the website or storefront before you buy or judge.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-100 rounded-2xl p-6">
